	(text "Bodge wires to the U21 footprint (7): +16V5 pads 1-3, -16V5 pads 6-8 / EP 24, +15V pads 20-22, -15V pads 14-16, GND pads 5/11/13/19/23, PGP_15V pad 4, PGN_15V pad 9."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 21 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "01fe40f3-8469-5411-9ffb-02b2c3a67ca4")
	)
	(text "Values carry over from U21: VOUT = 100 uA x RSET (147k = 14.7 V); PGFB 432k/10k trips near 13.3 V (both parts use a 300 mV PGFB threshold). LT3094 exposed pad 13 is IN (-16V5), not GND; VIOC floats when unused."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 27 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "13f24aa4-b763-5ad6-96a8-17a55334e5f8")
	)
	(text "BODGE: LT3097 (U21) replacement. U21 stays unpopulated; this daughterboard is wired to its nets. Parts on this sheet are excluded from the PCB and BOM."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5603ef30-dbeb-547c-b349-80ff36c54f33")
	)
